CM_ "Legacy Model 3/Y, chassis bus (DashKit bus 0). One DBC per bus: an id can be a different message on each. Messages DashPilot reads keep the definitions of bus_1_tesla_vehicle.dbc, except DI_speed (full layout: 9-bit DI_uiSpeed, units at bit 33) and, not read by the app today, BMS_chgPowerAvailable (39|12) and VCRIGHT_logging1HzIndex (5 bits). The others come from the ESP32-DualCAN project (Model3_CH.dbc / Model3_VEH.dbc, github.com/dzid26, CERN-OHL-W v2: this file stays under that licence), as each message comment says. Checked against full-bus recordings of a 2023 Model Y RWD (78 min, 2026-11-20). UNK_ messages: seen on the car, no public definition, named after their id.";
